ame":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2024-11-12T12:08:09Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T15:30:52Z","closed_at":"2025-01-27T02:50:54Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\r\n\r\n- Reproducible in `v4.3.stable.arch_linux`\r\n- Was okay till `v4.2.stable.arch_linux`, I haven't tested since then.\r\n\r\n### System information\r\n\r\nGodot v4.3.stable unknown - Garuda Linux #1 ZEN SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Fri, 01 Nov 2024 03:30:35 +0000 - Wayland - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon Graphics (RADV RENOIR) - AMD Ryzen 5 7530U with Radeon Graphics (12 Threads)\r\n\r\n### Issue description\r\n\r\nI go to paint physics layers on the TileSet in the TileSet Editor.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3300a3cd-4dcd-4481-99da-42405ca68043)\r\n\r\nTo adjust the shape with precision, I click the expand editor button, and all the control buttons (the bar) overlap with the tabs above (Tiles and Patterns)\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/923037b0-38b3-4d43-b5e5-d32558c1423f)\r\n\r\nIt should be below the tabs, inside the panel.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n1. Create any TileMap or TimeMapLayer\r\n2. Go to TileSet Tab and import any tileset sprite.\r\n3. Add a physics layer to the TileMap\r\n4. Go to Paint Mode in Tiles\r\n5. Select Physics Layer\r\n6. Select any Tile so that the blue coloured area cropper becomes visible\r\n7. Click the Expand Editor button\r\n8. The Cropper takes up the full panel, with the controls bar at the very top overlapping with the tabs\r\n\r\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\r\n\r\nNot needed since this is a Layout issue","closed_by":{"login":"HarshNarayanJha","id":50262541,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMjYyNTQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50262541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HarshNarayanJha","html_url":"https://github.com/HarshNarayanJha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HarshNarayanJha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HarshNarayanJha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HarshNarayanJha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HarshNarayanJha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HarshNarayanJha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HarshNarayanJha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HarshNarayanJha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HarshNarayanJha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HarshNarayanJha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_